      "id": "claim_7d8a3afbdff84c8dadb734032cb18e04",
      "statement": "The character-frame conversion has one named definition per side — training_data.build_training_set for training and CharacterSpacePose.Extract for inference — because a disagreement between them about frame, units or rate convention does not throw and shows up only as bad motion.",
